\fs28 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 status
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec5 \'a0(e.g.\'a0
\fs28 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 not_ready_for_payment
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec5 ) and include a message with code such as\'a0
\fs28 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 intervention_required
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec5 \'a0and a human-readable explanation.\
\ls10\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Unknown capabilities:
