\cf2 Extensions\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \AppleTypeServices \cf2 The ACP\'a0
\f0\b Extensions Framework
\f1\b0 \'a0lets sellers add optional capabilities to checkout (e.g., discount codes, loyalty, future features) in a standardized way. Extensions are advertised and negotiated through\'a0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.agenticcommerce.dev/docs/concepts/capability-negotiation"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \strokec2 capability negotiation}}, and they add well-defined fields to the core checkout schema so agents can discover and use them without changing the base protocol.\

\f0\b\fs64 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 Why extensions?\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs24 \AppleTypeServices \cf2 The core Agentic Checkout API is designed to stay stable. New features (discounts, loyalty programs, subscriptions, etc.) should be\'a0
\f0\b optional and composable
\f1\b0 \'a0so that:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Sellers
\f1\b0 \'a0can adopt only the extensions they need.\
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Agents
\f1\b0 \'a0can ignore extensions they don\'92t support and still complete checkouts.\
\ls12\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 The spec
\f1\b0 \'a0can evolve with new extensions without breaking existing implementations.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \strokec2 Extensions integrate with the same\'a0
\fs28 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 capabilities
\fs24 \cf2 \cb1 \strokec2 \'a0object used for\'a0{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.agenticcommerce.dev/docs/concepts/capability-negotiation"}}{\fldrslt \cf2 \strokec2 capability negotiation}}: agents declare which extensions they understand in the request, and sellers return which extensions are\'a0
\f0\b active
\f1\b0 \'a0for that session in the response.\

\f0\b\fs64 \AppleTypeServices\AppleTypeServicesF65539 \
