\ls13\ilvl0
\f0\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	1	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Agent request
\f1\b0 \'a0\'97 The agent sends\'a0
\fs28 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 capabilities.extensions
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec5 \'a0as an array of\'a0
\f0\b extension identifiers
\f1\b0 \'a0(e.g.\'a0
\fs28 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 ["discount"]
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec5 ) to indicate which extensions it understands.\
\ls13\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	2	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec5 Seller response
\f1\b0 \'a0\'97 The seller includes\'a0
\fs28 \cf3 \cb4 \strokec3 capabilities.extensions
\fs24 \cf0 \cb1 \strokec5 \'a0as an array of\'a0
\f0\b extension declaration
\f1\b0 \'a0objects. Each declaration describes one extension that is active for this session and which schema fields it adds.\
